# Deployment gateway

**Terraform apply**, **`deploy-fast` / `deploy-full`**, and **production changelog** updates must follow **`.cursor/skills/deployment-ops`**.

## Load the skill when the user asks to

- Deploy bot to dev or prod
- Run `terraform plan/apply`
- Fix Function App / infra settings
- Append [`docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md`](../../docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md)

## If the skill is not loaded

1. Do not run deploy/terraform scripts ad hoc from memory.
2. Read `.cursor/skills/deployment-ops/SKILL.md` first.

## Changelog

Prod deploys: append [`docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md`](../../docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md) in the same session as `./scripts/deploy.sh prod` on **`release`**. Read-only sessions do not require changelog writes.

## Coordination

| Related work | Skill |
|--------------|--------|
| Corpus / Pinecone / SharePoint files | `knowledge-base-curator` |
| Evaluate answers after deploy | `bot-quality-evaluation` |

**Changelog:** same session as prod deploy; SHA on `release`. Append [`docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md`](../../docs/deployments/CHANGELOG.md).

**Scripts:** `scripts/terraform.sh`, `scripts/deploy.sh` (or `terraform.cmd` / `deploy.cmd` on Windows). **Infra spec:** [`infrastructure/README.md`](../../infrastructure/README.md).

Runtime: **`dev`** Docker image — [`.cursor/skills/deployment-ops/docker-images.md`](../../.cursor/skills/deployment-ops/docker-images.md).
